  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EARLY FLOOD WARNING PREPARATION, MITIGATION STRATEGIES, RESILIENCE AND LIVELIHOOD COPING STRATEGIES TRAINING OF RESIDENTS IN SELECTED COMMUNITIES IN O</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy is supporting MEI with funding to undertake a project entitled: Early Flood Warning Preparation, Mitigation Strategies, Resilience and Livelihood Coping Strategies Training of Residents in Selected Communities in Ogbaru LGA in Anambra State. The project is responding to the impact of extreme weather condition by rebuilding the resilience and livelihoods of communities and people affected by flooding and other natural disaster in communities in Ogbaru LGA of Anambra state. The project aims to improve the coping strategy and resilience of 300 affected households.</narrative>
  </description>
